{
  "_comment": "WhatsApp Flow: NIETE registration v6 (2026-11-11). v5.1 plus one screen, IS_THIS_YOU, after SCHOOL_PICK (\"Is this you?\"). Endpoint-driven (data_api_version 3.0, POST /api/flows/registration). `version` is Meta's Flow JSON schema version, not this asset's revision.",
  "_notes": [
    "WHY v6: after Pick your school, a first-time registrant may be asked about ONE other live account at that school with her name (unused, or silent over 30 days). The screen shows only her typed first name, the school and at most the last two digits of that account's number. The endpoint decides whether to show it; the switch registration_is_this_you_enabled is off by default, and with it off v6 behaves exactly like v5.1.",
    "form_rev \"6\" rides on the SCHOOL_PICK, IS_THIS_YOU and TEACHING payloads so the endpoint can tell a v6 session from a v5.1 one still in flight: a v5.1 session never sees the question and never settles one.",
    "SUCCESS declares `identity` (claimed, review or none): an undeclared extension_message_response param is stripped. The welcome adds one line for claimed or review.",
    "IS_THIS_YOU has no init-values on purpose: nothing is pre-selected. Its names avoid the envelope's reserved keys (action, screen, flow_token, data, version).",
    "Everything else is v5.1 unchanged, including the close: the endpoint's TEACHING reply names SUCCESS and carries extension_message_response, which closes the Flow. ROLLBACK: registration-flow-v5.1.json stays in the repo; republish it to go back."
  ],
  "version": "7.0",
  "data_api_version": "3.0",
  "routing_model": {
    "PERSONAL_INFO": [
      "ROLE_SCHOOL"
    ],
    "ROLE_SCHOOL": [
      "SCHOOL_PICK"
    ],
    "SCHOOL_PICK": [
      "IS_THIS_YOU",
      "TEACHING"
    ],
    "IS_THIS_YOU": [
      "TEACHING"
    ],
    "TEACHING": [
      "SUCCESS"
    ],
    "SUCCESS": []
  },
  "screens": [
    {
      "id": "PERSONAL_INFO",
      "title": "Registration / رجسٹریشن",
      "data": {
        "languages": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "ur",
              "title": "اردو"
            },
            {
              "id": "en",
              "title": "English"
            }
          ]
        },
        "init_language": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "ur"
        },
        "init_full_name": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Ayesha Siddiqa"
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "personal_form",
            "init-values": {
              "full_name": "${data.init_full_name}",
              "language": "${data.init_language}"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "Welcome to NIETE"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "Tell us a little about you. It takes about a minute.\nاپنے بارے میں تھوڑا سا بتائیں۔ ایک منٹ لگے گا۔"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextInput",
                "name": "full_name",
                "label": "Name / نام",
                "input-type": "text",
                "required": true,
                "helper-text": "Your full name · آپ کا پورا نام"
              },
              {
                "type": "RadioButtonsGroup",
                "name": "language",
                "label": "Language / زبان",
                "required": true,
                "data-source": "${data.languages}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "Next / آگے",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "full_name": "${form.full_name}",
                    "language": "${form.language}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ROLE_SCHOOL",
      "title": "Registration / رجسٹریشن",
      "data": {
        "t_heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Your role and school"
        },
        "t_role_label": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Your role"
        },
        "t_search_label": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "School name or EMIS"
        },
        "t_search_help": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "e.g. IMSG G-9/1, a village name or the EMIS code"
        },
        "t_search": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Search"
        },
        "roles": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "teacher",
              "title": "Teacher"
            },
            {
              "id": "principal",
              "title": "Principal / Head Teacher"
            }
          ]
        },
        "show_role": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "__example__": true
        },
        "init_role": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "teacher"
        },
        "init_query": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "IMSG G-9/1"
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "role_school_form",
            "init-values": {
              "role": "${data.init_role}",
              "school_query": "${data.init_query}"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.t_heading}"
              },
              {
                "type": "RadioButtonsGroup",
                "name": "role",
                "label": "${data.t_role_label}",
                "required": false,
                "visible": "${data.show_role}",
                "data-source": "${data.roles}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextInput",
                "name": "school_query",
                "label": "${data.t_search_label}",
                "input-type": "text",
                "required": true,
                "helper-text": "${data.t_search_help}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "${data.t_search}",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "role": "${form.role}",
                    "school_query": "${form.school_query}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SCHOOL_PICK",
      "title": "Registration / رجسٹریشن",
      "data": {
        "t_heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Pick your school"
        },
        "t_note": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Schools matching “G-9/1”. Not in the list? Go back and search again, or choose “My school isn’t here”."
        },
        "t_pick_label": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Your school"
        },
        "t_next": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Next"
        },
        "schools": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "a1b2",
              "title": "IMSG G-9/1",
              "description": "IMSG(I-X) G-9/1 · Urban-II · EMIS 424"
            },
            {
              "id": "none",
              "title": "My school isn’t here"
            }
          ]
        },
        "init_school": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "a1b2"
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "school_pick_form",
            "init-values": {
              "school_id": "${data.init_school}"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.t_heading}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.t_note}"
              },
              {
                "type": "RadioButtonsGroup",
                "name": "school_id",
                "label": "${data.t_pick_label}",
                "required": true,
                "data-source": "${data.schools}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "${data.t_next}",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "school_id": "${form.school_id}",
                    "form_rev": "6"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "IS_THIS_YOU",
      "title": "Registration / رجسٹریشن",
      "data": {
        "t_heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Is this you?"
        },
        "t_body": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "There’s already an account for Ayesha at IMSG G-9/1, made with a number ending in 47. Is it yours? If it is, I’ll link it to this number."
        },
        "t_answer_label": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Your answer"
        },
        "answers": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "yes",
              "title": "Yes, it’s mine"
            },
            {
              "id": "no",
              "title": "No, it’s someone else’s"
            },
            {
              "id": "not_sure",
              "title": "I’m not sure"
            }
          ]
        },
        "t_next": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Next"
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "is_this_you_form",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.t_heading}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.t_body}"
              },
              {
                "type": "RadioButtonsGroup",
                "name": "is_this_you",
                "label": "${data.t_answer_label}",
                "required": true,
                "data-source": "${data.answers}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "${data.t_next}",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "is_this_you": "${form.is_this_you}",
                    "form_rev": "6"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "TEACHING",
      "title": "Registration / رجسٹریشن",
      "data": {
        "t_heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Your grades and subjects"
        },
        "t_note": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Pick all that apply. No class of your own? Leave these empty."
        },
        "t_grades": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Grades"
        },
        "t_subjects": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Subjects"
        },
        "t_finish": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Finish"
        },
        "grades": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "grade_1",
              "title": "Grade 1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "subjects": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": [
            {
              "id": "maths",
              "title": "Mathematics"
            }
          ]
        },
        "init_grades": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "__example__": [
            "grade_1"
          ]
        },
        "init_subjects": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "__example__": [
            "maths"
          ]
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Form",
            "name": "teaching_form",
            "init-values": {
              "grade": "${data.init_grades}",
              "subjects": "${data.init_subjects}"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TextHeading",
                "text": "${data.t_heading}"
              },
              {
                "type": "TextBody",
                "text": "${data.t_note}"
              },
              {
                "type": "CheckboxGroup",
                "name": "grade",
                "label": "${data.t_grades}",
                "required": false,
                "data-source": "${data.grades}"
              },
              {
                "type": "CheckboxGroup",
                "name": "subjects",
                "label": "${data.t_subjects}",
                "required": false,
                "data-source": "${data.subjects}"
              },
              {
                "type": "Footer",
                "label": "${data.t_finish}",
                "on-click-action": {
                  "name": "data_exchange",
                  "payload": {
                    "grade": "${form.grade}",
                    "subjects": "${form.subjects}",
                    "form_rev": "6"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SUCCESS",
      "title": "Registration / رجسٹریشن",
      "terminal": true,
      "data": {
        "t_heading": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "You’re registered"
        },
        "welcome_message": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Welcome, Ayesha! Tap Done and I’ll send your NIETE portal link in the chat."
        },
        "t_done": {
          "type": "string",
          "__example__": "Done"
        },
        "extension_message_response": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "params": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "registration_action": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "flow_token": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "full_name": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "language": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "school_linked": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "identity": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "__example__": {
            "params": {
              "registration_action": "complete",
              "flow_token": "uuid:registration:1760000000000",
              "full_name": "Ayesha Siddiqa",
              "language": "ur",
              "school_linked": "yes",
              "identity": "none"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "type": "SingleColumnLayout",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "TextHeading",
            "text": "${data.t_heading}"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBody",
            "text": "${data.welcome_message}"
          },
          {
            "type": "Footer",
            "label": "${data.t_done}",
            "on-click-action": {
              "name": "complete",
              "payload": {
                "registration_action": "complete"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
